    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Linked list</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Deep copy</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/copy-list-with-random-pointer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 138</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Copy List with Random Pointer</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A deep copy needs a map from each old node to its new node. Put each copy right after its original (A -> A' -> B -> B') and the list itself becomes that map: A'.random = A.random.next. Three passes, O(n) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
